<%# The working readout (M4): a static tag plus the Abort key, replaced by the
    stream's working events. The tag is instrumentation voice (rule 5) and the
    Abort key is the interactable signal; no motion (rule 6). The element id
    is the turbo-stream replace target — the stream must never touch anything
    else in the wrapper. Locals: working, session_id. %>
<div id="session-status">
  <% if working %>
    <span class="instrumentation status-tag">working</span>
    <%= button_to "Abort", abort_session_path(session_id), class: "button button--small button--secondary" %>
  <% end %>
</div>
